    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Se þe þam unscyldegan sceððeþ, oððe þam scyldegan scyldeþ for metsceattum oðð for æniges mannes lufan oððe feonge, he biþ eft geniðerad fram ðam ecan deman.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Whoever harms the guiltless or shields the guilty for money, or for hatred or love of any man, he will afterwards be condemned by the eternal judge.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Qui innocentem opprimit et dimittit noxium pro pecunia uel amicitia uel odio uel quacumque factione, opprimetur ab omnipotente iudice.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
